schemas.ScheduledRefreshPreview.description='Read-only comparison of the saved scheduled snapshot and current selector resolution. Device identities are distinct within each list; the combined union is bounded to10000. Ready is true exactly when blockers is empty; an empty proposed selection is blocked. New UUIDs without complete typed bindings produce VARIABLE_BINDING_REQUIRED; the actor-bound token covers frozen bindings, source settings, saved/proposed membership and an internal monotonic revision so delayed requests cannot overwrite a newer review, including an ABA change. Matching no-op does not mutate or audit. Names and connection status are display metadata. Current saved selection does not attribute an earlier request or establish activation.';
