// Agent updates. The "Agent updates" section of contracts/CONTRACT.md is the contract; these are its machine-readable shapes. The enumerations come from the reference rules of the shared vectors, so a schema, the vectors and the section name the same codes and states.
const maxSafe=9007199254740991;
